# ---- 170_the_hook_a_repository_already_has_survives.py
# ------------------ chamnan's one write outside .chamnan/ lands beside somebody else's hook
# 🎯 [R3.10.10, 2026-09-16] chamnan's only write outside `.chamnan/` is an opt-in line in the user's
# pre-commit hook, and MOST real repositories already have one — husky, pre-commit, lefthook, or a
# script somebody wrote. `corpus_sweep.py` proves the updater across chamnan's own 37 released
# versions; nothing had ever run it against a hook another tool owns.
