# 🎯 [owner 2026-09-22] *"it should load only what pairs with the most recent work ... CLAUDE.md
# governs on top anyway, but the rules still matter — they are the SECONDARY rules, so keep the
# others waiting to be called."*
#
# `rules_text` ordered by pin, then by mtime. Newest-first is a fair tie-break and a poor
# importance signal, and the file records the cost in its own comment: `the-set-not-the-member.md`
# is this repository's most-recorded defect and was arriving as a TITLE ONLY, then was violated
# about twenty hours after being written, while unreadable.
