# get a BODY at any ordering: the shortest is 3,642 characters against a 4,750-character runaway
# guard for the whole section, so all 22 arrive as titles either way. The ordering pays where there
# is room — a smaller repository, a shorter rule — and on a saturated one it changes which titles
# come first and nothing else. Recorded here so the next reader does not mistake the change for a
# saving it never made.
